'''''A Moment of Peace''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Today Is Yesterday's Tomorrow]].

==Steps==
# Search for other researchers that need help
# Continue to look around the master control zone and report to Asta
# Clear the obstacles and continue forward

