===Search for other researchers that need help{{subst:void|<!--100030110-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Master Control Zone|update|The space station's external crisis seems to be under control but the researchers remain uneasy.<br />Many of them were alone when they came here. What do they care about the most now? The space station? Their colleagues? Or is it the research itself?<br />It's obvious that everyone's answer is different.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Eikura Shuu)
:'''Eikura Shuu:''' Why did those monsters have to breach the ionizing grid on my watch...
:'''Eikura Shuu:''' It can't be my fault, I'd never make a mistake like this... I'm going out there to check the data again!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're injured.
::'''Eikura Shuu:''' Injured? I don't care, see anyone else that cares? Who are you anyway, get out of my way.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's dangerous outside.
::'''Eikura Shuu:''' Dangerous? Of course it's dangerous, I just came back from the front line, I know that better than you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't be a hero.
::'''Eikura Shuu:''' Hero? Don't overthink it. I'm not doing this for others, I'm doing it for myself.
:'''Eikura Shuu:''' The space station shield's first line of defense is the anti-gravity ionizing grid. I'm the researcher in charge of it. Do you expect me to just sit here after something like this?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's not your fault.
::'''Eikura Shuu:''' I agree. But when the investigation's over, the blame will fall entirely on my shoulders.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's over now.
::'''Eikura Shuu:''' That may be the case, but it's better than just hiding here doing nothing.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Please, just stay here.
::'''Eikura Shuu:''' Hmph... it's easy for you to say! This didn't happen on your watch, you wouldn't understand!
:'''Eikura Shuu:''' Besides, that bunch of troublemakers is still out there... I know you mean well, but I've made up my mind.
----

;(Talk to Lukacs)
:'''Lukacs:''' We researchers have all taken refuge here, but has anyone given any thought to the non-human life on this space station?
:'''Lukacs:''' They may be part of the rare item collection, but are they not also living things? Don't their rights deserve to be protected!?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Non-human life?
::'''Lukacs:''' Yes. Non. Human. Life. Living creatures that aren't human...
::'''Lukacs:''' ...Some of which have been collected as rare items and housed in the space station. Most of the researchers disregard their basic rights.
::'''Lukacs:''' Even now, with death staring them in the face, they still refuse to open their minds.
::'''Lukacs:''' And I, Lukacs, outstanding researcher of the Herta Department of Galactic Geopolitics, must awaken those pretending to sleep!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Rare item collection?
::'''Lukacs:''' At the space station, we've always collected rare items &mdash; countless articles from across the galaxy. But not everyone knows that among these articles are also living things.
::'''Lukacs:''' And I, Lukacs, outstanding researcher of the Herta Department of Galactic Geopolitics, must emphasize in this time of crisis that their lives and rights should also be respected!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Protecting their rights?
::'''Lukacs:''' Exactly! And I, Lukacs, outstanding researcher of the Herta Department of Galactic Geopolitics, shall continue fighting and speaking up for the rights of all non-human life in these terrible times!
:'''Lukacs:''' If you are interested in joining the cause, please stand by my side and repeat after me!
:'''Lukacs:''' Protect rare item rights! Save non-human life!
:'''Lukacs:''' All together! Protect rare item rights...!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Protect rare item rights!
::'''Lukacs:''' You did well, friend! Follow my rhythm, and say it loud, with conviction!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Save non-human life!
::'''Lukacs:''' Perfect, my friend. Now let us work together and invite more supporters to join us!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I think I should leave.
::'''Lukacs:''' Hmph! Just another egocentric anthropocentrist!
::'''Lukacs:''' Open your benighted eyes and look at the delicate life around you!
:'''Lukacs:''' Protect rare item rights! Save non-human life!
{{Dialogue End}}

===Continue to look around the master control zone and report to Asta{{subst:void|<!--100030202-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Master Control Zone|update|The space station's external crisis seems to be under control. If there are places you haven't been to yet, now's the chance to go and take a look.<br />Once everything has been taken care of, go and report to Asta.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Space Station Broadcast:''' All injured researchers, please stay where you are. Medical staff will be arriving immediately... Here's an emergency notice.
:<!--3-second delay-->
:'''Space Station Broadcast:''' Would {{MC|м=Mr.|ж=Ms.}} (Trailblazer), Ms. March 7th, and Mr. Dan Heng please proceed immediately to the master control station. Lead Researcher Asta is waiting for you.
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
:{{tx}}

;(Talk to Asta)
:'''Asta:''' It's you! Thanks for helping out on the station.
:'''Asta:''' Did you encounter some problems?
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} Are you all right?
::'''Asta:''' The Legion is gone, and the Curios are back. Various departments are returning to their research, and the newly imported goods from the cosmos are beginning to circulate.
::'''Asta:''' Everything is going smoothly with Project Revival. So what exactly does this letter mean?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I heard you are looking for me?
::'''Asta:''' (Trailblazer), you're back. Just in time!
::'''Asta:''' Thanks to your help and everybody's hard work, the space station is pretty much back on its feet.
::'''Asta:''' As a conclusion to Project Revival, I wanted to summon you to witness the fruits of our labor.
::'''Asta:''' But just two days ago, I received a strange letter. Now that you're here, perhaps you can help me figure out what it is about.
:<pre>{
