::'''Asta:''' So now, the easy part. (Trailblazer), can you contact the Realm-Keeping Commission to file a report, launch an investigation, and retrieve the money?
::'''Asta:''' I will go chat with Wen Furui and talk some sense into him. I'll teach him about the rudimentary scamming technique that the Foxian Beauty Chat employs.
::'''Asta:''' Oh, look, someone else is contacting you.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} About the Foxian Beauty Chat...
::'''Asta:''' Ah, the plot thickens.
::'''Asta:''' But, if she does have a manager, why would she use her own alias to contact you?
::'''Asta:''' Normally, when things like this happened, her manager would be on the ball to deal with hiccups like this.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Maybe she didn't tell her manager.
:::'''Asta:''' Not telling her manager isn't completely unbelievable, but why?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Her conscience, maybe?
:::'''Asta:''' Her conscience... telling her not to cheat you out of your money and trying to return your money to you without the higher-up knowing.
:::'''Asta:''' What kindness.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Maybe she's the manager herself.
:::'''Asta:''' Uh... didn't you say the manager was male?
:::'''Asta:''' ...Wouldn't this be a little too cruel to Researcher Wen?
::'''Asta:''' Here's an idea. What if you go and meet up with the manager before meeting her? I think that might be safer. If you can find him, ask about her, and if you can't, just forget about it. It's not that big of a deal.
;(If )
:{{Диалог|undefined}} About the Foxian Beauty Chat...
::'''Asta:''' So it turns out the Foxian Beauty is neither foxian nor a beauty... I'm going to have to think of a way to break this news to Wen Furui.
::'''Asta:''' Can you ask that "Foxian Beauty" to record a video for Wen Furui, where she says "I don't think the two of us make a good pair, please forget me forever," or something to that effect?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's very thoughtful of you.
:::'''Asta:''' I'm afraid that if he finds out the truth, he'll be devastated beyond recovery.
:::'''Asta:''' That researcher is a little soft on the inside. And we didn't do all of this investigating just so we could mock him for it, right?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's pretty brutal of you.
:::'''Asta:''' I think a message from the Foxian Beauty will do much more good than our talking and explaining.
:::'''Asta:''' If you think it's brutal, maybe you can ask the Foxian Beauty to convey her sentiments more gently?
::'''Asta:''' Actually, there's no reason to trouble you with such a trivial errand. I'll handle this one myself.
::'''Asta:''' You know, maybe there is a foxian lady out there who would be a good match for him. Perhaps I should seriously consider transferring him to a post at Xianzhou.
