:::'''Asta:''' I have heard as much. But I think that's just an excuse people tell themselves.
:::'''Asta:''' The way I see it, the love between two people isn't less valuable because life is short. After all, everything is short-lived compared to the universe.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You are indeed a thoughtful Lead Researcher.
:::'''Asta:''' Well, what else can I do? Watching out for my fellow researchers is part of the job.
